<title>UK: Fairey shares bounce amid positive comment.</title>
<headline>Fairey shares bounce amid positive comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Fairey Group Plc bounced from recent weakness on Monday after positive weekend press comment, traders said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 14p at 595 by 0911 GMT. On Thursday it set its lowest close since last February.</p>
<p>A report in the Sunday Times said recent declines in the stock represented a buying opportunity and that the planned Burnfield Plc acquisition would enhance earnings.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 5106</p>
